SqliteSqliteError.documentation:
Human-readable details; do not parse for control flow.

```tsrust
import { open } from "std:sqlite";

function main() {
  const db = unwrap(open(":memory:"));

  match (db.prepare("SELEC 1")) {
    Ok(_) => {
      console.log("prepared");
    },
    Err(error) => {
      console.log(error.code, error.message.length > 0);
    }
  }
}
// prints: sqlite true
```

Log the message for diagnosis; branch on `code`.

Ownership: read from the owned error.

