Combines the elements from left to right: `callback(accumulator, element, index, array)` returns the next accumulator.

@param callback - Returns the next accumulator, of the same type.
@param initialValue - The starting accumulator. Without it the first element is the start and the loop begins at the second; an empty array then throws.

