Cookie response attributes. path defaults to /; domain is omitted. maxAge is nonnegative int seconds, emitted exactly; clients may clamp its effective lifetime. secure, httpOnly and partitioned default false. sameSite accepts Strict, Lax or None, including lowercase. SameSite=None requires secure for browser acceptance. Expires, Priority and signed cookies are unsupported.

```tsrust
const options: CookieOptions = {
  secure: true, httpOnly: true, sameSite: "Strict"
};
```

