SharedLruCache.documentation:
Purges expired entries, looks up the key, and makes a found entry most recent. Missing or expired keys return undefined. A hit returns an independent owned copy, including nested data. Reading never extends the insertion TTL. Takes one key of the declared type. The returned value remains valid after another operation or handle destruction.

```tsrust
