Samples an unbiased integer in [min,max). Invalid equal/reversed bounds return Range before any entropy request. Valid calls seed the maintained generator from fallible operating-system randomness; Random reports entropy failure with no fallback. Even a singleton interval follows the valid-call entropy path.

