Omitted limits retain the compiled-size limit of 10485760 bytes, hybrid DFA cache limit of 2097152 bytes and nesting limit of 250. sizeLimit and dfaSizeLimit accept nonnegative int byte counts representable on the target; nestLimit accepts 0..4294967295. Explicit zero is passed through. Invalid ranges return Range; malformed or unsupported syntax returns Syntax; excessive compiled size returns SizeLimit; other backend compile failures return Compile. Limits do not bound total iteration results or impose a timeout.

