Also accepts a full `TcpStream` (use `stream.split()` for concurrent reading and writing) and a `CompressionReader`, whose errors add `CompressionError | SpawnError | ThreadError<undefined>`.

Ownership: borrows the reader until the task settles. Cancelling may leave a read chunk for the next call.

