Creates a LineReader without reading. Invalid bounds or buffer reservation return Err. Its 8192-byte read-ahead buffer is a working buffer, not a line or stream cap. Read ahead stays owned by the adapter.

Ownership: Consumes the reader and preserves its staged unread bytes.

```tsrust
