message.documentation:
Describes the failure for people, including invalid argument details or backend diagnostics. This owned string has no default and its wording can depend on the failing stage or input; branch on code rather than parsing message text. Reading it does not mutate the error, retry work or recover partial output. The example shows the explicit level-range diagnostic.

